<td class="gallery-item-heading" style="width: 50%;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur montes det</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Text</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-text" style="width: 50%;">
<p>The Bellini College of Artificial Intelligence, Cybersecurity and Computing was established to position the University of South Florida at the forefront of the technological transformation that impacts every facet of modern life. As the university&rsquo;s center of AI, cybersecurity and computing, the college&rsquo;s unique hub and spoke model connects academic disciplines, industry, research and the next generation of students to address complex challenges and create new opportunities. Building on USF&rsquo;s strengths as an AAU institution and the growing Tampa Bay technology-forward ecosystem, the Bellini College advances groundbreaking research, drives innovation and fosters the responsible development and application of emerging technologies.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-image" style="width: 50%;"><img src="/ai-cybersecurity-computing/images/00_promophotos/ai-plus-x-3rd-symposium-490x327.jpg" alt="Alt Text" width="653" height="436" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image Alignment. Accepted values: left, right</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-alignment" style="width: 50%;" data-select-list="left, right">right</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table class="gallery-band-bg-color" style="width: 100%;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Gallery Item - Band with Background Color</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<table class="gallery-text" style="width: 100%;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Gallery Item - Text</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<table class="two-column-text">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" width="50%">Column 1</th>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" width="50%">Column 2</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<h3>Vision</h3>
<p>To be the leader positioning the Tampa Bay region as a national economic engine in AI, cybersecurity, computing education and research, fostering interdisciplinary innovation, ethical technology development, along with significant industry and government partnerships.</p>
</td>
<td>
<h3>Mission</h3>
<p>Dedicated to transforming the role of computing technologies through high-demand academic programs, research excellence and trusted, responsible innovation.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<table class="gallery-text-image" style="width: 100%;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" colspan="2">Gallery Item - Text and Image <br />Image Dimensions - Width: 460 px, Height: 300 px* <br />* Recommended height.</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading Display. Accepted values: yes, no</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading-display" style="width: 50%;" data-select-list="yes, no">yes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading</p>
</td>

<td class="gallery-item-heading" style="width: 50%;">Values</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Text</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-text" style="width: 50%;">


<table class="toggle-section">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Toggle Section</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-text">Collaborative synergy</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-content">
<p>We value a cohesive academic environment where the college serves as the university&rsquo;s central hub for AI and cybersecurity, connecting distinct disciplines as spokes. We believe that integrating artificial intelligence and cybersecurity with fields such as medicine, science, engineering, the arts, humanities and business creates a dynamic force that exceeds the capabilities of isolated endeavors. We are committed to maintaining the integrity of existing departments while facilitating extensive interdisciplinary collaborations that bridge technical expertise with various fields.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<table class="toggle-section">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Toggle Section</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-text">Student empowerment and workforce readiness</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-content">
<p>We are dedicated to elevating student success by preparing a pipeline of graduates with deep technical skills and ethical grounding required by the modern workforce. We value curricula that are rigorous, relevant and responsive to the sustained demand for high-skilled professionals in AI and cybersecurity. We are committed to ensuring our graduates secure high-wage positions and possess the agility to adapt to rapid technological change.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<table class="toggle-section">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Toggle Section</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-text">Transformative and responsible innovation</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-content">
<p>We pursue innovative research excellence that pushes the boundaries of knowledge while strictly adhering to ethical standards. We value curiosity, creativity, and critical thinking, striving to solve large-scale societal problems through convergence research. We are committed to instilling a deep sense of responsibility in our community, promoting ethically driven policies that mitigate potential risks, ensure security and accountability, protect privacy and foster trust in digital transformation.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<table class="toggle-section">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Toggle Section</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-text">Strategic partnership and economic impact</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-content">
<p>We view industry and government collaboration not only as a resource but also as a core component of our mission. We value deep integration with partners, ranging from defense agencies to tech giants, to co-develop curricula, accelerate commercialization and drive Florida's economic prosperity. We strive to be the primary source of high-quality computing talent for our partners and a catalyst for regional economic growth.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<table class="toggle-section">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Toggle Section</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-text">Operational excellence and stewardship</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="toggle-content">
<p>We are committed to sustainable growth and financial self-sufficiency. We value the efficient use of resources through a "flat" administrative structure that minimizes bureaucracy and fosters agility. &ldquo;Flat structure" means no departmental administrative overhead, modeled after the USF College of Nursing and Northeastern University&rsquo;s Khoury College of Computing. We are dedicated to maintaining a robust financial base through various revenue streams, including tuition, research funding, and philanthropy, to ensure the college's long-term viability and national prominence.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

</td>
</tr>


<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image</p>
