</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-image" style="width: 50%;"><img src="/ai-cybersecurity-computing/images/00-academic-pages/bs-ms-pathway-490x327px.jpg" alt="Success" width="490" height="327" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image Alignment. Accepted values: left, right</p>
