<tr>
<td>
<h4>Our Process&nbsp;</h4>
<p>The strategic planning process was collaborative, data-informed, and action-oriented. Beginning with SWOT analyses and stakeholder engagement, the plan was refined through leadership review, KPI development, advisory board input, implementation planning and public feedback. The result is a shared vision for advancing artificial intelligence, cybersecurity and computing at USF.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td>
<h4>Strategic Planning Timeline&nbsp;</h4>
<p>Phase 1: Discovery and Synthesis (Aug-Dec 2025)&nbsp;<br />Phase 2: Metrics and Leadership Alignment (Jan 2026)&nbsp;<br />Phase 3: Unit Commitments and Governance (Feb 2026)&nbsp;<br />Phase 4: Execution Design (Mar 2026)&nbsp;<br />Phase 5: Publication and Adoption (Apr 2026)&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
